WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.170 --> 00:00:04.000
SCP-682 Vs SCP-162.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.700
The Hard to Destroy reptile was brought in
front of the nightmarish contraption known

00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:12.679
as the “Ball of Sharp”, a malevolent ball
of sharp objects that draws its victims in

00:00:12.679 --> 00:00:14.179
and tears them apart.

00:00:14.179 --> 00:00:17.660
682 screamed profanities
as it was brought before the ball.

00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:22.030
It then extended its deadly hooks, tearing
off one of 682’s forelimbs and its bottom

00:00:22.030 --> 00:00:23.840
jaw after a violent struggle.

00:00:23.840 --> 00:00:29.180
That’s when 682 broke containment, dragging
162 along with it and using it to slaughter

00:00:29.180 --> 00:00:33.829
eleven different members of personnel, as
well as injuring nearly 90 others.

00:00:33.829 --> 00:00:37.649
Two additional deaths were caused during the
recovery, and the researchers who had organized

00:00:37.649 --> 00:00:40.050
the cross-test were all given a disciplinary.

